<title>FRANCE: Ciments Francais suspended limit-up.</title>
<headline>Ciments Francais suspended limit-up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ciments Francais were suspended limit up after a near 10 percent rise, the SBF French Bourses' Association said.</p>
<p>The share will requote at 0830 GMT with an upper limit of 231.80 francs and a lower limit of 215.50.</p>
<p>Ciments Francais on Tuesday said it expected a significant increase in its results for the second half of the year. The company is controlled by Italcimenti.</p>
</text>
